WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.074 --> 00:00:01.258
- Hi, I'm Ted.

00:00:01.258 --> 00:00:02.535
With Harry Shearer retiring,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.081
I'm auditioning for any part
I can get in the Simpsons.

00:00:05.331 --> 00:00:06.831
(whip crack)

00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:07.861
(marker squeaks)

00:00:08.021 --> 00:00:09.071
(playful music)

00:00:09.071 --> 00:00:14.071
Smithers, release the hounds. Excellent.

00:00:14.366 --> 00:00:15.866
Hi-dilly-ho, neighbor!

00:00:15.866 --> 00:00:17.706
Ok-ely, doke-ely, neighbor-ino!

00:00:17.706 --> 00:00:21.481
One of the great exchanges
between Homer and Lisa:

00:00:21.481 --> 00:00:24.825
But, Dad! I'm a vegetarian.

00:00:24.825 --> 00:00:26.288
I don't eat animals.

00:00:26.288 --> 00:00:30.026
But Lisa. Animals are so delicious.

00:00:30.026 --> 00:00:32.534
There's the animal we get bacon from,

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:34.368
the animal we get ham from,

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:36.760
the animal we get sausage from...

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.335
Dad! That's all the same animal.

00:00:40.335 --> 00:00:43.516
Oh, sure, Lisa. A magic animal

00:00:43.516 --> 00:00:46.395
that all the wonderful foods come from.

00:00:46.395 --> 00:00:49.902
Kang and Kodos in one of the great classic

00:00:49.902 --> 00:00:51.620
episodes when they run for president.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:52.734
I'm running for president, now,

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:54.429
and you know, it's really tough.

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:56.426
Forward, not backwards!

00:00:56.426 --> 00:00:58.655
Upwards, not downwards!

00:00:58.655 --> 00:01:01.883
And always twirling, twirling for freedom.

00:01:02.303 --> 00:01:04.413
I have been told many times,

00:01:04.413 --> 00:01:07.780
I have a face for radio, and
I have a face for animation.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:11.513
(upbeat music)

